__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
pytest-cache-files-*/
# The record root, whole: `.keel/review/` was narrowed to the export directory, so the default run
# record (`runs.jsonl`, and `review-context.json` beside it) showed up as untracked noise in every
# repository that ran `keelcheck gate run`. Records are the tool's own history, not source.
.keel/
# Scratch the lanes create inside the checked-out repo, by pattern rather than one name at a time:
# `.assay-tmp/` (Sift), `.folio-tmp/` (Folio) and whatever the next lane calls its own must not need a
# hand-added line, because a scratch directory that has to be added by hand is one that eventually gets
# committed by hand. `.keel-*/` is kept separately: it covers the suite's own scratch helpers
# (`.keel-test-tmp`, `.keel-write-probe-*`), and the probe prefix does not end in `-tmp`.
.*-tmp/
.keel-*/

# Held on the machine that ran them, not published: UTF-16 suite captures that carry the author's
# workspace root, which the 2026-10-16 path pass took out of the tree (see PROJECT-STATE.md).
tests/_artefacts/assay_suite_*.txt
